#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:1 cd113a0c8ec24e53848e22180aa011b2
msgid ""
"Run Buildings, Roads and Forest detection in a single Mapflow workflow and "
"get one topology-corrected GeoJSON output."
msgstr "在一个 Mapflow 工作流中同时运行建筑物、道路和森林识别，输出经拓扑校正的统一 GeoJSON。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:7 5afedb14f1e6430e99dcbd1aea88e9ed
msgid "Buildings + Roads + Forest"
msgstr "建筑物 + 道路 + 森林"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 8bb522a2f92048c0b8c06696e3cb818d
msgid ":mf-chip:`road|Basemaps` :mf-badge:`Default model`"
msgstr ":mf-chip:`road|底图` :mf-badge:`默认模型`"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst 91fcd0eb785843b89e611b5df332477f
msgid "Buildings, roads and forest layers over a dense urban area"
msgstr "密集城区的建筑物、道路和森林图层"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 3c784fcfb7da45f29328850a47c565f9
msgid "Example result: buildings, roads and forest from one run."
msgstr "示例结果：一次运行得到的建筑物、道路和森林。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 9d866b45043f4d52b0afc19f0dac35ce
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "费用"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 21cc204e070b4ad19fd848ab3ca5b551
msgid "23 credits per km² + imagery"
msgstr "每 km² 23 积分 + 影像"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 ba4bbf865b2e4ef2a48561dba88e75eb
msgid "Example: 10 km² on Mapbox zoom 19 ≈ 320 credits."
msgstr "示例：Mapbox 缩放级别 19 下 10 km² ≈ 320 积分。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 28d499a1b74a41d8a5b46d7e3f5aa666
msgid ""
"Runs the Buildings, Roads and Forest models as one workflow and returns a "
"single topology-corrected result, so the layers do not overlap. It costs "
"less than running the three models one by one."
msgstr "将建筑物、道路和森林模型作为一个工作流运行，返回拓扑已校正的单一结果，使各图层互不重叠。费用低于分别运行三个模型。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 1d50dd0e9294464fbb0f5cceb6faeadd
msgid "What you get"
msgstr "输出结果"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 9b6f6318646445749c166d15c3f21da3
msgid "Buildings, roads and forest from one run, as separate styled layers."
msgstr "一次运行得到建筑物、道路和森林，分别输出为带样式的独立图层。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 cd25ccfaf975456fb0d2556c43dc5baf
msgid "Works best with"
msgstr "最佳适用影像"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 5c28ec339e37495ea78d407dbd570c9f
